<title>DENMARK: Danish May wholesale prices up 1.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish May wholesale prices up 1.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish wholesale prices rose by 0.8 percent in May 1997 from April 1997 and were up 1.9 percent from May 1996, the national statistics office said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>					 May 1997   April 1997  May 1996</p>
<p>    Change on month (percent)    +0.8	  +0.9	 +0.6</p>
<p>    Change on year (percent)     +1.9	  +1.6	 +1.5</p>
<p>    Index (base year 1990=100)   106.8	105.9	104.8</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office changed the index base year to 1990 from 1980, effective April 1994. Analysts had forecast an unchanged 1.6 percent yr/yr WPI rise for May and a 0.6 percent rise on the month. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969650</p>
